","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_Venti_05","linkedConstellations":null},"5":{"skillId":2222,"type":2,"name":"暴風之眼","description":"<color=#FFD780FF>風神之詩</color>效果結束後，會為溫迪恢復15點元素能量；\\n若產生了元素轉化，則同樣為隊伍中所有對應元素的角色恢復15點元素能量。","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_Venti_06","linkedConstellations":null},"6":{"skillId":2223,"type":2,"name":"恆風隨行","description":"隊伍中自己的角色滑翔消耗的體力降低20%。\\n無法與效果完全相同的固有天賦疊加。","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_Explosion_Glide","linkedConstellations":null},"9":{"skillId":2251,"type":2,"name":"魔女的前夜禮·頌時風若","description":"完成<color=#FFD780FF>魔女的課業·風起之題</color>後，溫迪將成為<color=#FFD780FF>魔導</color>角色。隊伍中編入至少2名魔導角色時，將獲得<color=#FFD780FF>魔導·秘儀</color>效果，使魔導角色獲得強化。\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>魔導·秘儀</color>\\n元素爆發<color=#FFD780FF>風神之詩</color>創造的暴風之眼存在期間，附近的目前場上角色觸發擴散或星擴散反應後的4秒內，該角色造成的傷害提升50%，並使溫迪自己的暴風之眼造成原本135%的傷害。","descriptionBuff":"","icon":"UI_Talent_S_Venti_07","linkedConstellations":null}},"constellation":{"0":{"id":0,"talentId":221,"name":"弦發的蒼風","description":"<color=#FFD780FF>瞄準射擊</color>會額外發射兩枚分裂箭，分別造成原本33%的傷害。","descriptionBuff":"<color=#FFD780FF>瞄準射擊</color>會額外發射兩枚分裂箭，分別造成原本33%的傷害。\\n此外，<color=#FFD780FF>颶風箭</color>也會額外發射兩枚能追蹤敵人的箭矢，分別造成原本20%的傷害，該效果每0.25秒至多觸發一次。","extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Venti_01","advancedProps":[{"name":"Extra Arrow (Physical)","elementalGaugeTheory":"—","internalCooldown":{"tag":{"span":"4","text":"Charged Attack"},"type":{"span":"4","text":"1s/3 Hits"}},"interruptionResistance":"1","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Light","horizontalForce":"200","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false},{"name":"Extra Arrow (Physical, Hit Weak Spot)","elementalGaugeTheory":"—","internalCooldown":"rowspan","interruptionResistance":"4","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Light","horizontalForce":"200","verticalForce":"0"},"bluntAttack":false},{"name":"Extra Arrow (Anemo)","elementalGaugeTheory":"1U","internalCooldown":"rowspan","interruptionResistance":"2","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Air","horizontalForce":"480","verticalForce":"600"},"bluntAttack":false},{"name":"Extra Arrow (Anemo, Hit Weak Spot)","elementalGaugeTheory":"1U","internalCooldown":"rowspan","interruptionResistance":"8","interruptionResistanceStagger":{"staggerLevel":"Air","horizontalForce":"480","verticalForce":"600"},"bluntAttack":false}]},"1":{"id":1,"talentId":222,"name":"眷戀的泠風","description":"<color=#FFD780FF>高天之歌</color>會使敵人的<color=#80FFD7FF>風元素抗性</color>與物理抗性降低12%，持續10秒。\\n被<color=#FFD780FF>高天之歌</color>擊飛的敵人在落地前，<color=#80FFD7FF>風元素抗性</color>與物理抗性額外降低12%。","descriptionBuff":"<color=#FFD780FF>高天之歌</color>會使敵人的<color=#80FFD7FF>風元素抗性</color>與物理抗性降低24%，持續10秒。\\n此外，施放元素爆發<color=#FFD780FF>風神之詩</color>後，溫迪將獲得<color=#FFD780FF>風起之時</color>效果，並重置元素戰技<color=#FFD780FF>高天之歌</color>的冷卻時間。<color=#FFD780FF>颶風箭</color>命中敵人後，也會有25%機率使溫迪獲得<color=#FFD780FF>風起之時</color>效果。\\n\\n<color=#FFD780FF>風起之時</color>\\n點按施放元素戰技<color=#FFD780FF>高天之歌</color>時，將造成原本300%的傷害。該效果持續15秒，並將在溫迪點按施放元素戰技<color=#FFD780FF>高天之歌</color>後移除。","extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Venti_02"},"2":{"id":2,"talentId":223,"name":"千風的詩篇","description":"<color=#FFD780FF>風神之詩</color>的技能等級提高3級。\\n至多提升至15級。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":{"addTalentExtraLevel":{"talentType":"AvatarSkill","talentIndex":9,"extraLevel":3}},"icon":"UI_Talent_U_Venti_02"},"3":{"id":3,"talentId":224,"name":"自由的凜風","description":"溫迪獲得元素晶球或元素微粒後，獲得25%<color=#80FFD7FF>風元素傷害加成</color>，持續10秒。","descriptionBuff":"溫迪施放元素戰技<color=#FFD780FF>高天之歌</color>或元素爆發<color=#FFD780FF>風神之詩</color>後，溫迪與隊伍中自己的目前場上其他角色獲得25%<color=#80FFD7FF>風元素傷害加成</color>，持續10秒。","extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Venti_03"},"4":{"id":4,"talentId":225,"name":"高天的協奏","description":"<color=#FFD780FF>高天之歌</color>的技能等級提高3級。\\n至多提升至15級。","descriptionBuff":null,"extraData":{"addTalentExtraLevel":{"talentType":"AvatarSkill","talentIndex":2,"extraLevel":3}},"icon":"UI_Talent_U_Venti_01"},"5":{"id":5,"talentId":226,"name":"抗爭的暴風","description":"受<color=#FFD780FF>風神之詩</color>傷害的敵人，<color=#80FFD7FF>風元素抗性</color>降低20%；\\n若產生了元素轉化，則使轉換的元素抗性也降低20%。","descriptionBuff":"受<color=#FFD780FF>風神之詩</color>傷害的敵人，<color=#80FFD7FF>風元素抗性</color>降低20%。\\n若產生了元素轉化，則使轉換的元素抗性也降低20%。\\n此外，溫迪對這些敵人造成的傷害，還會獲得100%暴擊傷害加成。","extraData":null,"icon":"UI_Talent_S_Venti_04"}},"dictionary":null,"buff":true}}